      "heading": "题目描述",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>求 <span class=\"katex math inline\">a/b</span> 的结果。</p>\n<p>已知 <span class=\"katex math inline\">a</span>，<span class=\"katex math inline\">b</span> 为 <span class=\"katex math inline\">10^8</span> 范围内的非负整数，求 <span class=\"katex math inline\">a/b</span> 保留前 <span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span> 位小数商的结果。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "求 a/b 的结果。\n已知 a，b 为 10^8 范围内的非负整数，求 a/b 保留前 n 位小数商的结果。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输入",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>读入三个整数 <span class=\"katex math inline\">a</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">b</span> <span class=\"katex math inline\">n</span>。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "读入三个整数 a b n。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "输出",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                <div class=\"markdown\"><p>输出一行数字。</p>\n</div>            </div>",
      "text": "输出一行数字。"
    },
    {
      "heading": "样例",
      "html": "<div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"sample-test\">\n                        <div class=\"input\">\n                            <h4>输入</h4>\n                            <pre>97 61 50</pre>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"output\">\n                            <h4>输出</h4>\n                            <pre>1.59016393442622950819672131147540983606557377049180</pre>\n                        </div>\n\n                        \n                                            </div>\n                </div>",
